        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen, front profile melamin resin, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen, front profile melamin resin, at plant
na;
UUID: df0f1341-341d-314d-baaf-3a37ed74fdbb
This data set includes the basic structure of the kitchen cupboards (melamin coated particle board, 16 mm) and the front cover (melamin coated, 19 mm). Screws and hinges are considered. The countertop is not included. Sink, cooker hood and waste system are included. The kitchen cupboards have an usable volume of 3.36 m3.  The area of front cover is 8.9 m2.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_df0f1341-341d-314d-baaf-3a37ed74fdbb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
